  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "To see which gene partnerships hold up in each of our 12 rheumatoid synovium biopsies, I want a gene-gene correlation map for every biopsy separately, with a significance value attached to each link. The expression matrix is log2-transformed and centered, with gene IDs as rows and biopsy names in the header."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I want a gene-gene correlation map for every biopsy separately, with a significance value attached to each link.\" -- available from LIONESS-COEXPRESSION.\n2. \"with a significance value attached to each link.\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set.\n3. \"To see which gene partnerships hold up in each of our 12 rheumatoid synovium biopsies\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set.\n\nSelected path: **LIONESS-COEXPRESSION**.\n\nYour question asks for a per-sample co-expression network. **LIONESS-COEXPRESSION** fits that result and scale.\n\n**LIONESS-COEXPRESSION** — Infer aggregate and sample-specific co-expression networks with LIONESS. LIONESS represents the cohort network through sample contributions: W_q = N*W_all - (N-1)*W_without_q, where N is the cohort size and the same base estimator is fitted with and without sample q. The leave-one-out network alone is not the patient's network. This borrows cohort information; it does not estimate a correlation from one isolated observation or prove causality. With PANDA, edge weights are inferred regulatory support, not measured binding strength. Cross-sectional networks do not establish temporal rewiring.\n\nRequired workflow inputs:\n\n- `expression_file`: expression matrix\n\nOutputs:\n\n- `coexpression_network`: Inferred gene-to-gene associations.\n\nAsk for the workflow's controls and defaults if you want to set them.\n\nThis is workflow guidance only; no execution was authorized. No files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
